Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project speaks the WebKit Remote Inspector protocol and the Chrome DevTools
Protocol. It contains no code from either project.

The Rust types under `crates/mjx-wk-protocol/src/generated/` are produced by
`xtask codegen` from the machine-readable protocol descriptions shipped with
WebKit (`Source/JavaScriptCore/inspector/protocol/*.json`, BSD-2-Clause,
Copyright Apple Inc. and others). Those descriptions are consulted locally and
are NOT redistributed here — `reference/webkit-protocol/` is git-ignored. The
generated Rust is an independent expression of the interface they describe and
is covered by this project's Apache-2.0 licence.

Protocol member names, domain names, and enum wire tokens are facts about an
interface and are reproduced as required for interoperability.

No part of this project links against, embeds, or bundles WebKit, WebKitGTK,
WebView2, or any system webview. That is a hard architectural rule, enforced in
CI by `cargo run -p xtask -- verify-no-webview`.
